#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Alpha Team — Adventure Mode Mission 1 ("Mission One", M1010) Complete (#299, #300).
#
# Starts from a fresh --data-root, creates Adventure Slot 1, skips the Training
# Area (M0010) to enter Mission One (M1010), skips Ogel's intro cutscene, cycles
# to Cam 2, opens Direction Tile Actor19387's Unit Menu and rotates it 90 deg CW
# (East toward the bridge), triggers live execution (GO) so Dash runs across the
# bridge to trigger Plunger Lock OG0019B and open Skull Door OG0019A, reaches
# Mission Victory ("We did it!"), persists adventure progress (HighSpace M1010,
# P0Space M1020 in Game.txt), returns to HQ, and exits cleanly via Exit Game ->
# Yes (PostMessageA(WM_DESTROY) -> PostQuitMessage(0) -> Exited(0)).
#
# Pointer arithmetic matches menu.route / select-adventure.route: DDMouse
# recenters Win32 cursor to (320, 240) each flip and steers 1/1280 of the screen
# per raw pixel (0.5 px/raw_x, 0.375 px/raw_y) from bottom-left (0, 480).
#
# Flip landmarks (640x480x16, 30 Hz):
#   flip 1792       Attract screen -> Space to load Main Menu (MM.PUZ at 1865)
#   flip 2252       Main Menu -> Adventure -> Select Adventure
#   flip 2352       Select Adventure -> Slot 1 (New) -> Adventure Briefing
#   flip 2452       Adventure Briefing X -> load M0010 Training Area (2539)
#   flip 2760       Dismiss M0010 destination modal -> Menu (2842) -> Skip Training (2942)
#   flip 2942       Game.txt written (109 B: P0Space M1010); M1010.PUZ loads (3029)
#   flip 3545       Dismiss "Destination: Mission One" modal -> Ogel intro cutscene
#   flip 3588       Escape skips Ogel intro cutscene; camera pans into M1010
#   flip 3711,3744  Tab x2 cycles Cam 0 -> Cam 1 (overview) -> Cam 2 (centered tile)
#   flip 3781       Click Direction Tile Actor19387 at (320, 125) -> Unit Menu opens
#   flip 3813       Click RotateCW in Unit Menu -> tile rotated 90 deg CW (East)
#   flip 3831       Space closes Unit Menu
#   flip 3860       Space (GO) launches live execution (Dash runs across bridge)
#   flip 4079       Dash hits Plunger Lock OG0019B; Game.txt updated (127 B: HighSpace M1010, P0Space M1020)
#   flip 4081       T0011_VICTORY.dds plays; Skull Door OG0019A opens (4130)
#   flip 4351       Reward_EN.dds ("We did it!") Mission Victory screen appears
#   flip 4488       Click Return to HQ -> Main Menu reloads (MM.PUZ at 4575)
#   flip 4710       Click Exit Game -> "Really Exit Game?" confirmation dialog
#   flip 4770       Click Yes -> PostMessageA(WM_DESTROY) -> NetImmerse shutdown -> Exited(0) at flip 4847
#
# Active 3D gameplay window for --fps-report: [3591..4480] (889 flips, 29.63s declared).

# Boot -> Attract screen -> Main Menu -> Adventure Slot 1 -> Skip Training -> M1010
flip 1792 key Space down
flip 1794 key Space up
flip 2232 move 480 9
flip 2234 move 480 9
flip 2236 move 480 9
flip 2238 move 480 9
flip 2252 down
flip 2254 up
flip 2332 move 46 219
flip 2352 down
flip 2354 up
flip 2432 move 523 433
flip 2434 move 523 433
flip 2436 move 523 433
flip 2452 down
flip 2454 up
flip 2760 down
flip 2762 up
flip 2800 move 36 320
flip 2802 move 36 320
flip 2804 move 36 320
flip 2842 down
flip 2844 up
flip 2920 move 492 20
flip 2922 move 492 20
flip 2924 move 492 20
flip 2942 down
flip 2944 up

# Dismiss "Destination: Mission One" modal and skip Ogel's intro cutscene.
flip 3545 down
flip 3547 up
flip 3588 key Escape down
flip 3590 key Escape up

# Cycle camera twice (Cam 0 -> Cam 1 -> Cam 2) so Direction Tile Actor19387 sits at (320, 125).
flip 3711 key Tab down
flip 3713 key Tab up
flip 3744 key Tab down
flip 3746 key Tab up

# Steer up onto Direction Tile Actor19387 and open its Unit Menu.
flip 3777 move 320 93
flip 3781 down
flip 3783 up

# Steer to RotateCW in the Unit Menu and rotate Actor19387 90 deg CW (East toward bridge).
flip 3809 move 280 80
flip 3813 down
flip 3815 up

# Close Unit Menu, then press Space (GO) so Dash crosses the bridge to Plunger Lock OG0019B.
flip 3831 key Space down
flip 3833 key Space up
flip 3860 key Space down
flip 3862 key Space up

# On "We did it!" Mission Victory screen, steer to Return to HQ and return to Main Menu.
flip 4480 move 360 470
flip 4482 move 320 470
flip 4484 move 320 280
flip 4488 down
flip 4490 up

# On Main Menu (cursor sits on Exit Game), click Exit Game, wait for confirm dialog, and click Yes.
flip 4710 down
flip 4712 up
flip 4760 move 192 219
flip 4770 down
flip 4772 up
